---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions - JKSPDC"
  description="Terms and Conditions of use for the official JKSPDC website. Governing law, intellectual property, disclaimer, and user obligations."
>
  <div class="space-y-0">
    <!-- Page Header Band -->
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="current">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 prose-gov space-y-5">

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold">
          ⚠️ <strong>DRAFT — FOR JKSPDC LEGAL REVIEW AND FORMAL APPROVAL BEFORE PUBLICATION.</strong> This document is a standard template and must be reviewed by JKSPDC's legal/administrative department before being treated as the official Terms &amp; Conditions.
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing and using the official website of Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL) (hereinafter "the Website"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of this Website immediately.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">2. Ownership &amp; Purpose</h2>
          <p>This Website is owned and operated by <strong>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited</strong>, a wholly-owned Public Sector Undertaking of the Government of Jammu &amp; Kashmir. The Website is provided as an official information portal for citizens, investors, vendors, employees, and other stakeholders.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on this Website — including text, graphics, logos, images, documents, and data — is the intellectual property of JKSPDCL or the Government of Jammu &amp; Kashmir unless otherwise stated. Reproduction of content for non-commercial and educational purposes is permitted with appropriate attribution to JKSPDCL.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">The JKSPDCL logo and name may not be used, reproduced, or displayed without prior written permission.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>The information on this Website is provided in good faith for general information and transparency purposes. JKSPDCL makes reasonable efforts to ensure accuracy, but does not warrant that:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• The Website will always be available, error-free, or uninterrupted</li>
            <li>• All information is complete, current, or accurate at all times</li>
            <li>• The Website is free from viruses or other harmful components</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">For authoritative legal and binding information, refer to official Gazette notifications and Government orders.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">5. External Links</h2>
          <p>This Website may contain links to external websites for user convenience. JKSPDCL does not endorse, control, or take responsibility for the content of external websites. Users access external links at their own risk. External links are clearly indicated with appropriate labelling.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">6. Prohibited Use</h2>
          <p>You must not use this Website for:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Any unlawful purpose or in violation of applicable laws</li>
            <li>• Transmitting harmful, offensive, or defamatory content</li>
            <li>• Attempting to gain unauthorised access to any part of the system</li>
            <li>• Misrepresenting your identity or affiliation</li>
            <li>• Scraping, data mining, or automated access without prior written consent</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">7. Privacy</h2>
          <p>Your use of this Website is also governed by our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated by reference into these Terms &amp; Conditions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">8. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by the laws of India and the jurisdiction of courts in Jammu &amp; Kashmir. Any dispute arising from use of this Website shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts in Srinagar/Jammu, as applicable.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">9. Modifications</h2>
          <p>JKSPDCL reserves the right to modify these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time. Updated terms will be published on this page with a revised effective date. Continued use of the Website following any changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-base mb-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">10. Contact</h2>
          <p>For any queries regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact:</p>
          <div class="mt-2 text-sm space-y-1">
            <p><strong>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited</strong></p>
            <p>Exhibition Grounds, Jahangir Chowk, Srinagar — 190009</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in" class="text-[#0B4F9C] hover:underline">md-jkspdcl@jk.gov.in</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
          <strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 2026 | <strong>Last Reviewed:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}
        </p>

      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="space-y-5">
        <div class="card-static">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card-title">Legal &amp; Policies</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="sidebar-link">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="sidebar-link">Disclaimer</a></li>
            <li><a href="/copyright" class="sidebar-link">Copyright Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/hyperlinking-policy" class="sidebar-link">Hyperlinking Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/accessibility-statement" class="sidebar-link">Accessibility Statement</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
